   "अतः धारा $2i=\\frac{15-0.7}{1\\times10^3}=\\frac{14.3}{1\\times10^3}$",
   "या $i=\\frac{14.3}{2\\times10^3}=$ **$7.15\\times10^{-3}$ A**"
  ]
 },
 {
  "k": "sec",
  "text": "पेज संख्या 810"
 },
 {
  "k": "q",
  "n": "1",
  "lines": [
   "$\\alpha=0.98,\\ \\Delta I_E=10$ mA",
   "$\\Delta I_C=\\alpha\\times\\Delta I_E$",
   "$=0.98\\times10=$ **$9.8$ mA**",
   "आधार धारा में परिवर्तन",
   "$\\Delta I_B=\\Delta I_E-\\Delta I_C$",
   "$=10\\text{ mA}-9.8\\text{ mA}=$ **$0.2$ mA**"
  ]
 },
 {
  "k": "q",
  "n": "2",
  "lines": [
   "$\\beta=99,\\ \\alpha=?$",
   "सूत्र $\\alpha=\\frac{\\beta}{\\beta+1}=\\frac{99}{99+1}=\\frac{99}{100}=$ **$0.99$**"
  ]
 },
 {
  "k": "q",
  "n": "3",
  "lines": [
   "$\\alpha=0.98,\\ \\beta=?$",
   "सूत्र $\\beta=\\frac{\\alpha}{1-\\alpha}$ से",
   "$\\beta=\\frac{0.98}{1-0.98}=\\frac{0.98}{0.02}=$ **$49$**"
  ]
 },
 {
  "k": "q",
  "n": "4",
  "lines": [
   "$\\Delta I_E=4.00$ mA, $\\Delta I_C=3.84$ mA",
   "$\\alpha=\\frac{\\Delta I_C}{\\Delta I_E}=\\frac{3.84}{4}=$ **$0.96$**",
   "तथा $\\beta=\\frac{\\alpha}{1-\\alpha}=\\frac{0.96}{1-0.96}=\\frac{0.96}{0.04}=$ **$24$**"
  ]
 },
 {
  "k": "q",
  "n": "5",
  "lines": [
   "$\\alpha=0.98,\\ R_L=5\\text{ k}\\Omega=5\\times10^3\\Omega$",
   "$V_L=5$ वोल्ट $=V_{CE}$",
   "उभयनिष्ठ उत्सर्जक विन्यास में",
   "$i_C=\\frac{V_{CE}}{R_L}$",
   "$=\\frac{5}{5\\times10^{+3}}=10^{-3}$ ऐम्पियर",
   "धारा लाभ $\\beta=\\frac{\\alpha}{1-\\alpha}=\\frac{0.98}{1-0.98}$",
