   "अतः $\\beta=\\frac{I_C}{I_B}$",
   "या $I_B=\\frac{I_C}{\\beta}=\\frac{1\\times10^{-3}}{49}$",
   "$I_B=0.0204\\times10^{-3}$ ऐम्पियर",
   "$=20.4\\times10^{-6}$ ऐम्पियर",
   "$=$ **$20.4\\ \\mu$A**"
  ]
 },
 {
  "k": "q",
  "n": "6",
  "lines": [
   "$\\beta=30,\\ R_L=4\\text{ k}\\Omega,$",
   "$R_i=400\\Omega$",
   "वोल्टेज प्रवर्धन $A_V=\\frac{R_L}{R_i}\\times\\beta$",
   "$=\\frac{4000}{400}\\times30=$ **$300$**"
  ]
 },
 {
  "k": "q",
  "n": "7",
  "lines": [
   "$\\beta=19,\\ \\Delta I_B=0.4$ मिलीऐम्पियर",
   "$\\Delta I_C=?\\ \\Delta I_E=?$",
   "सूत्र $\\beta=\\frac{\\Delta I_C}{\\Delta I_B}$ से",
   "$19=\\frac{\\Delta I_C}{0.4}$",
   "या $\\Delta I_C=19\\times0.4=$ **$7.6$ mA**",
